1
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:23,899
Do you still remember what he looks like?

2
00:00:24,980 --> 00:00:26,679
I'd recognize his bones even if he was skinned.

3
00:00:27,019 --> 00:00:28,780
Bro, did we come all this way

4
00:00:28,839 --> 00:00:30,160
just for one fight and head back?

5
00:00:38,619 --> 00:00:39,960
They've brought the fight to our doorstep.

6
00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:41,280
We're definitely taking him down.

7
00:00:41,859 --> 00:00:43,119
Let these city folks know

8
00:00:43,240 --> 00:00:44,600
West Suburbs men aren't to be messed with.

9
00:00:45,119 --> 00:00:45,500
That's right!

10
00:00:45,880 --> 00:00:47,359
Li's taking us to the city to run the turf!

11
00:00:48,719 --> 00:00:49,140
Let's go!

12
00:01:10,799 --> 00:01:11,260
Zhuzi!

13
00:01:12,519 --> 00:01:12,959
Haizhu!

14
00:01:16,040 --> 00:01:17,280
Isn't this Zhou Meng's bike?

15
00:01:19,620 --> 00:01:20,799
How'd it get so wrecked?

16
00:01:21,319 --> 00:01:22,579
Did you really go to the West Suburbs?

17
00:01:23,280 --> 00:01:24,319
You bet I did.

18
00:01:25,379 --> 00:01:26,480
What about my bike?

19
00:01:27,739 --> 00:01:28,280
What am I gonna do?

20
00:01:28,280 --> 00:01:29,719
It's just a bike. Where'd it go?

21
00:01:32,019 --> 00:01:33,260
Why did you, of all things...

22
00:01:33,540 --> 00:01:34,980
...insist on buying a 26-inch lady's bike?

23
00:01:35,680 --> 00:01:36,819
Who were you trying to show off to?

24
00:01:37,219 --> 00:01:38,219
Showing off to you, obviously!

25
00:01:39,040 --> 00:01:39,739
Like I care!

26
00:01:41,359 --> 00:01:43,299
Mengmeng, your bike's been found!

27
00:01:45,120 --> 00:01:45,599
Everyone!

28
00:01:45,780 --> 00:01:46,359
Come over here, quick!

29
00:01:46,400 --> 00:01:47,219
Come see, come take a look!

30
00:01:47,579 --> 00:01:48,579
Liu Haizhu...

31
00:01:48,719 --> 00:01:50,219
...infiltrated the thieves' den all alone...

32
00:01:50,480 --> 00:01:51,659
...and took back Zhou Meng's bike!

33
00:01:51,780 --> 00:01:52,439
Isn't that awesome?

34
00:01:52,920 --> 00:01:53,480
Way to go, Haizhu!

35
00:01:53,659 --> 00:01:54,099
Tell me, isn't that awesome?

36
00:01:54,200 --> 00:01:54,959
All right, all right, Sanbiangua.

37
00:01:55,079 --> 00:01:55,739
Give it here.

38
00:01:55,760 --> 00:01:56,500
Wait, bro, bro, bro!

39
00:01:56,620 --> 00:01:58,079
Hold on, tell me what happened!

40
00:02:08,699 --> 00:02:09,159
Zhou Meng.

41
00:02:30,900 --> 00:02:31,639
Take a seat.

42
00:02:35,800 --> 00:02:36,879
You can put your coat here.

43
00:02:42,620 --> 00:02:43,020
Don't.

44
00:02:43,539 --> 00:02:44,560
That's someone else's bed.

45
00:02:45,159 --> 00:02:46,199
Sit on the stool.

46
00:02:47,659 --> 00:02:48,240
Right, right.

47
00:02:58,259 --> 00:02:58,680
Have a seat.

48
00:03:05,099 --> 00:03:05,939
Are you all right?

49
00:03:07,419 --> 00:03:08,080
I'm fine.

50
00:03:09,199 --> 00:03:10,659
You call that fine?

51
00:03:11,240 --> 00:03:13,360
Look, your button fell off.

52
00:03:14,500 --> 00:03:15,219
Wait, this...

53
00:03:19,900 --> 00:03:20,599
Hold still.

54
00:03:21,139 --> 00:03:22,340
Let me sew the button back on.

55
00:03:22,860 --> 00:03:23,960
Careful, I don't want to prick you.

56
00:03:57,620 --> 00:03:58,400
All done. It's sewn up.

57
00:04:01,219 --> 00:04:01,819
Thanks.

58
00:04:04,419 --> 00:04:05,180
Y-You're welcome.

59
00:04:11,919 --> 00:04:13,659
Look at that. What's going on here?

60
00:04:13,979 --> 00:04:14,879
The hero and the beauty.

61
00:04:16,019 --> 00:04:17,579
Helping each other out.

62
00:04:17,740 --> 00:04:19,660
That's revolutionary friendship.

63
00:04:20,899 --> 00:04:22,160
Friendship comes first, right?

64
00:04:22,600 --> 00:04:23,699
What are we still doing here?

65
00:04:24,420 --> 00:04:26,220
Let's go. Don't be a third wheel.

66
00:04:26,300 --> 00:04:26,839
Let's go, come on.

67
00:04:27,699 --> 00:04:28,839
Um... well...

68
00:04:31,360 --> 00:04:32,720
Well, I... I'm heading out now.

69
00:04:33,560 --> 00:04:34,899
I'll bring the bike back once it's fixed.

70
00:04:43,240 --> 00:04:44,040
Xiur, look.

71
00:04:44,220 --> 00:04:45,500
I... I have a loose thread here.

72
00:04:45,620 --> 00:04:46,860
Where? Where is it?

73
00:04:46,980 --> 00:04:47,480
Let me see.

74
00:04:47,899 --> 00:04:48,680
Are you out of your mind?

75
00:04:49,939 --> 00:04:51,139
I lost a button too.

76
00:04:51,319 --> 00:04:52,000
What's wrong with you?

77
00:04:52,180 --> 00:04:53,279
Then let me bite it off for you.

78
00:04:53,639 --> 00:04:55,459
See? Isn't a button missing here too?

79
00:04:55,639 --> 00:04:56,899
Your button fell off too.

80
00:04:57,360 --> 00:04:58,959
Help, a pervert! Murder!

81
00:05:28,519 --> 00:05:29,019
Weasel.

82
00:05:30,779 --> 00:05:31,339
Weasel!

83
00:05:37,779 --> 00:05:39,120
Finally tracked you down.

84
00:05:40,240 --> 00:05:40,899
Li.

85
00:05:42,779 --> 00:05:43,579
What are you doing here?

86
00:05:43,620 --> 00:05:44,180
Come on, sit.

87
00:05:51,180 --> 00:05:51,720
Weasel,

88
00:05:52,339 --> 00:05:54,019
you're not doing so hot in the city.

89
00:05:54,160 --> 00:05:55,199
Look at this food.

90
00:05:55,779 --> 00:05:56,899
Not a single piece of meat.

91
00:05:57,480 --> 00:05:59,339
Who do you think you're calling "Weasel"?

92
00:05:59,560 --> 00:06:00,600
Show some damn respect!

93
00:06:01,079 --> 00:06:01,680
Like I always say,

94
00:06:01,860 --> 00:06:03,959
I'm somebody in this city now.

95
00:06:04,100 --> 00:06:04,980
Watch your mouth with me.

96
00:06:05,420 --> 00:06:06,360
Who do you think you are?

97
00:06:06,879 --> 00:06:07,439
Easy, don't, don't.

98
00:06:08,060 --> 00:06:08,699
Shut up!

99
00:06:09,060 --> 00:06:09,560
Huang Zhonghua.

100
00:06:10,019 --> 00:06:11,040
Find someone for me in the next two days.

101
00:06:11,240 --> 00:06:12,399
Who? Man or woman?

102
00:06:12,540 --> 00:06:13,180
Guy or girl?

103
00:06:15,459 --> 00:06:16,360
Just do what you're told.

104
00:06:16,360 --> 00:06:17,620
Cut the crap.

105
00:06:18,600 --> 00:06:19,600
I don't even know what they look like.

106
00:06:19,600 --> 00:06:20,459
Where am I supposed to look?

107
00:06:25,740 --> 00:06:26,639
Hey, don't touch that!

108
00:06:26,779 --> 00:06:27,480
That's my poetry collection.

109
00:06:27,600 --> 00:06:28,019
Give that back.

110
00:06:29,199 --> 00:06:30,100
Have Fang Er sketch them.

111
00:06:30,259 --> 00:06:31,779
He did all the brigade's blackboard posters.

112
00:06:33,060 --> 00:06:33,879
Aren't you eating?

113
00:06:33,980 --> 00:06:34,699
It's all yours.

114
00:06:48,240 --> 00:06:49,220
Just like this, got it?

115
00:06:49,379 --> 00:06:50,720
Go find him! Track him down!

116
00:06:55,920 --> 00:06:56,519
Listen up, boys!

117
00:06:57,079 --> 00:06:58,680
Find him for me within three days!

118
00:06:59,120 --> 00:06:59,779
That punk...

119
00:07:00,139 --> 00:07:01,379
He might be alive to steal my bike,

120
00:07:01,459 --> 00:07:02,019
but he won't live to ride it!

121
00:07:04,519 --> 00:07:05,540
What are you all doing here?

122
00:07:06,879 --> 00:07:08,800
You think my place is a soup kitchen?

123
00:07:09,240 --> 00:07:10,040
A whole bunch of you,

124
00:07:10,240 --> 00:07:12,100
no money, no ration coupons,

125
00:07:12,720 --> 00:07:15,319
barging into town bumming food and drink!

126
00:07:15,459 --> 00:07:16,600
What the hell do you want?

127
00:07:17,560 --> 00:07:18,839
Li brought us here to run the turf!

128
00:07:20,319 --> 00:07:21,759
Turf my ass, you shit-stirrers!

129
00:07:22,220 --> 00:07:23,579
You bunch of grown-ass men,

130
00:07:23,579 --> 00:07:25,000
are your assholes so loose

131
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:26,480
that you shat your damn hearts out?

132
00:07:26,759 --> 00:07:27,879
Look at you pathetic fools.

133
00:07:28,379 --> 00:07:29,100
And you!

134
00:07:29,180 --> 00:07:30,420
Run what turf?

135
00:07:31,399 --> 00:07:32,220
Your brother

136
00:07:32,339 --> 00:07:34,360
got punked by a pretty boy a couple days ago!

137
00:07:34,360 --> 00:07:36,040
Stop mooching food and drink

138
00:07:36,100 --> 00:07:37,259
and go settle this for him!

139
00:07:37,279 --> 00:07:38,240
Hold on, Ma! Ma, Ma!

140
00:07:38,779 --> 00:07:40,620
Auntie, loud and clear!

141
00:07:40,699 --> 00:07:41,800
The old boss is here.

142
00:07:41,860 --> 00:07:42,699
Sorry for the trouble.

143
00:07:43,339 --> 00:07:44,420
This meal today

144
00:07:44,439 --> 00:07:46,120
is courtesy of Huang Zhonghua.

145
00:07:46,560 --> 00:07:47,540
Once we finish eating,

146
00:07:47,540 --> 00:07:48,720
we'll take care of his problem right away!

147
00:08:08,740 --> 00:08:09,319
Zhou Meng!

148
00:08:11,040 --> 00:08:11,540
Zhou Meng!

149
00:08:19,439 --> 00:08:20,399
Take a look. What do you think?

150
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:22,899
It's all fixed.

151
00:08:24,180 --> 00:08:24,699
You fixed it?

152
00:08:25,500 --> 00:08:27,279
It's just your old bell had an issue...

153
00:08:27,379 --> 00:08:28,160
I couldn't fix it no matter what.

154
00:08:29,220 --> 00:08:29,939
It's fine.

155
00:08:30,319 --> 00:08:31,620
I'll get a replacement later.

156
00:08:32,139 --> 00:08:32,600
No need.

157
00:08:33,679 --> 00:08:34,639
I hammered out a new one by hand.

158
00:08:41,659 --> 00:08:43,320
Your bike repair skills are pretty good!

159
00:08:43,379 --> 00:08:44,279
What did you expect?

160
00:08:58,980 --> 00:08:59,860
Back then,

161
00:09:00,019 --> 00:09:02,139
all my happiness rode on this bike.

162
00:09:02,419 --> 00:09:04,440
My whole world was just the factory.

163
00:09:04,919 --> 00:09:05,840
I wished this road

164
00:09:06,259 --> 00:09:07,200
could go on a bit longer,

165
00:09:08,039 --> 00:09:09,820
so the two of us could ride on forever.

166
00:09:15,659 --> 00:09:16,940
Watch closely, tipping the scale!

167
00:09:18,259 --> 00:09:19,080
Here, 12 cents.

168
00:09:21,120 --> 00:09:21,759
Cut us a deal.

169
00:09:22,019 --> 00:09:23,759
Five grown men sharing one sweet potato,

170
00:09:23,779 --> 00:09:24,639
and you're still haggling?

171
00:09:25,960 --> 00:09:26,639
Quit your yapping.

172
00:09:29,240 --> 00:09:30,320
Treating the boys to a sweet potato...

173
00:09:31,320 --> 00:09:32,419
Aren't you generous?

174
00:09:34,120 --> 00:09:35,340
Why'd you block the school gate?

175
00:09:35,419 --> 00:09:36,259
And got beat up by students?

176
00:09:37,620 --> 00:09:38,320
Fuck off!

177
00:10:12,100 --> 00:10:15,039
Look at Haizhu doting on you every day.

178
00:10:15,879 --> 00:10:17,600
Does that mean you two are...

179
00:10:20,779 --> 00:10:21,799
Stop talking nonsense.

180
00:10:22,220 --> 00:10:23,259
So how do you feel about him?

181
00:10:26,200 --> 00:10:27,580
Haizhu's really nice.

182
00:10:28,980 --> 00:10:29,679
Really nice?

183
00:10:31,860 --> 00:10:32,539
Nice how?

184
00:10:33,940 --> 00:10:34,379
Well...

185
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:37,480
He has that dark tan,

186
00:10:38,360 --> 00:10:39,539
and he always grins like a goofball.

187
00:10:39,899 --> 00:10:42,279
Showing all his teeth when he laughs, heh heh.

188
00:10:42,340 --> 00:10:44,139
Isn't that what you like about him?

189
00:10:44,360 --> 00:10:46,259
He's loyal and straightforward.

190
00:10:46,460 --> 00:10:46,960
Right?

191
00:10:47,779 --> 00:10:48,759
Keep it down!

192
00:10:49,100 --> 00:10:50,179
Someone might hear you.

193
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:55,679
Old Xu.

194
00:10:57,360 --> 00:10:58,019
Mr. Feng.

195
00:10:58,340 --> 00:10:59,700
Off work so early today?

196
00:10:59,779 --> 00:11:00,539
Got some errands to run today.

197
00:11:02,120 --> 00:11:02,679
That's him!

198
00:11:11,879 --> 00:11:12,500
Stop!

199
00:11:13,039 --> 00:11:13,720
Stop right there!

200
00:11:17,159 --> 00:11:18,379
Lao Wu, get him!

201
00:11:19,279 --> 00:11:19,799
After him!

202
00:11:32,259 --> 00:11:33,200
What do you want to say?

203
00:11:33,360 --> 00:11:34,299
Just say it.

204
00:11:34,720 --> 00:11:36,159
When's the next poetry salon?

205
00:11:36,320 --> 00:11:36,940
I'll go with you.

206
00:11:37,039 --> 00:11:37,879
Zhou Meng.

207
00:11:38,379 --> 00:11:39,360
Mr. Feng.

208
00:11:39,779 --> 00:11:40,820
What brings you here?

209
00:11:43,279 --> 00:11:44,000
I just happened to be passing by,

210
00:11:44,320 --> 00:11:45,120
so I came to see you.

211
00:11:46,059 --> 00:11:47,320
A-And who is this?

212
00:11:48,980 --> 00:11:50,500
A new friend from the poetry salon.

213
00:11:50,899 --> 00:11:52,179
Feng Menglong, the poet.

214
00:11:53,480 --> 00:11:54,679
He also teaches at No. 1 High School.

215
00:11:55,299 --> 00:11:55,740
Hello.

216
00:11:57,720 --> 00:11:58,200
Hello.

217
00:12:00,720 --> 00:12:02,179
Why are you gripping so hard?

218
00:12:02,600 --> 00:12:03,820
Mr. Feng is an intellectual.

219
00:12:04,100 --> 00:12:04,779
Are you okay?

220
00:12:05,519 --> 00:12:06,059
I'm fine.

221
00:12:07,039 --> 00:12:07,980
Just call me Menglong.

222
00:12:09,179 --> 00:12:10,360
Since the day we first met...

223
00:12:10,799 --> 00:12:11,480
I figured...

224
00:12:11,659 --> 00:12:13,200
...you must be someone who loves life...

225
00:12:13,220 --> 00:12:14,139
...and loves poetry.

226
00:12:14,580 --> 00:12:15,580
This is my manuscript.

227
00:12:16,220 --> 00:12:17,200
It hasn't been published yet.

228
00:12:17,620 --> 00:12:18,379
I was thinking...

229
00:12:18,559 --> 00:12:19,639
...you should be the first to read it.

230
00:12:23,659 --> 00:12:24,559
Thank you.

231
00:12:25,019 --> 00:12:25,899
I was thinking...

232
00:12:26,059 --> 00:12:28,580
...perhaps you'd be their best reader.

233
00:12:31,039 --> 00:12:32,200
What's with all the thinking?

234
00:12:33,639 --> 00:12:34,340
Friend...

235
00:12:34,440 --> 00:12:35,980
Do you also like pondering poetry?

236
00:12:40,019 --> 00:12:40,639
Me?

237
00:12:40,759 --> 00:12:42,379
I don't sit around overthinking stuff.

238
00:13:07,259 --> 00:13:08,120
Think you can run?!

239
00:13:08,620 --> 00:13:09,279
Think you can ride?!

240
00:13:09,679 --> 00:13:10,600
Standing on the pedals, huh?!

241
00:13:10,720 --> 00:13:11,779
I'll beat your ass!

242
00:13:15,679 --> 00:13:16,779
I'll beat your ass!

243
00:13:17,379 --> 00:13:17,899
Take that!

244
00:13:19,399 --> 00:13:20,360
Three on one!

245
00:13:20,379 --> 00:13:21,559
A bunch of guys ganging up on him!

246
00:13:22,200 --> 00:13:23,340
What are you doing? Stop!

247
00:13:30,159 --> 00:13:30,600
Why, you...

248
00:13:30,720 --> 00:13:32,000
You little punk!

249
00:13:50,720 --> 00:13:51,159
I'll...

250
00:13:55,720 --> 00:13:56,159
Boss,

251
00:13:56,720 --> 00:13:57,399
I'll protect you!

252
00:13:58,080 --> 00:13:58,440
Bro,

253
00:13:59,059 --> 00:14:00,379
this is the punk who stole our bike.

254
00:14:11,720 --> 00:14:12,440
Haizhu!

255
00:14:19,320 --> 00:14:20,000
Someone, quick!

256
00:14:20,159 --> 00:14:21,700
Factory Security! There's a fight!

257
00:14:22,940 --> 00:14:24,500
Anyone there? There's a fight!

258
00:14:25,320 --> 00:14:26,419
What's all the racket?

259
00:14:26,740 --> 00:14:27,659
Looks like a fight broke out.

260
00:14:28,200 --> 00:14:28,860
Who's fighting?

261
00:14:28,919 --> 00:14:29,519
Go get Factory Security!

262
00:14:29,860 --> 00:14:31,279
Looks like Liu Haizhu is fighting someone!

263
00:14:31,500 --> 00:14:32,000
Hold on.

264
00:14:32,960 --> 00:14:33,620
Liu Haizhu?

265
00:14:38,299 --> 00:14:39,179
Then no need to call them.

266
00:14:39,639 --> 00:14:40,399
That's outside the factory gate.

267
00:14:41,220 --> 00:14:42,379
It's not an internal factory matter.

268
00:14:43,840 --> 00:14:44,299
Director!

269
00:14:44,460 --> 00:14:46,120
That girl from Shanghai is over there too!

270
00:14:47,379 --> 00:14:48,379
Then there's even less reason to call.

271
00:14:49,379 --> 00:14:50,179
Let her learn the hard way.

272
00:14:50,539 --> 00:14:51,220
It'll teach her a lesson.

273
00:14:52,460 --> 00:14:54,279
It's just a bunch of drifters brawling outside.

274
00:14:54,940 --> 00:14:55,679
Not the factory's business.

275
00:14:57,059 --> 00:14:57,539
Get back inside.

276
00:15:04,440 --> 00:15:04,960
Zhuzi!

277
00:15:05,539 --> 00:15:07,139
Fighting takes more than brute force.

278
00:15:07,519 --> 00:15:08,860
Watch which foot I ease up on,

279
00:15:09,220 --> 00:15:10,360
and which shoulder drops.

280
00:15:10,620 --> 00:15:11,960
Don't just fool around when fighting.

281
00:15:12,220 --> 00:15:13,580
Pay attention to the details.

282
00:15:23,220 --> 00:15:23,700
Here!

283
00:15:23,700 --> 00:15:24,139
Don't move!

284
00:15:27,100 --> 00:15:27,820
Nobody move!

285
00:15:28,899 --> 00:15:29,840
What do you think you're doing?

286
00:15:29,960 --> 00:15:31,240
Picking a fight at our factory gate!

287
00:15:31,460 --> 00:15:32,440
Don't get too cocky!

288
00:15:32,440 --> 00:15:33,360
We're not afraid of you!

289
00:15:33,779 --> 00:15:34,259
Boss!

290
00:15:34,740 --> 00:15:36,159
Heat's on, let's bolt!

291
00:15:36,539 --> 00:15:37,360
That's it for today!

292
00:15:38,379 --> 00:15:38,799
Remember this:

293
00:15:38,799 --> 00:15:41,179
I'm Li Canran from the West Suburbs!

294
00:15:41,779 --> 00:15:42,600
If you think you're tough,

295
00:15:42,600 --> 00:15:44,080
don't bother showing up for work.

296
00:15:44,899 --> 00:15:46,220
I'll beat you every time I see you!

297
00:15:46,899 --> 00:15:47,659
Mark my words!

298
00:15:47,840 --> 00:15:48,720
Seeing your coworkers here,

299
00:15:48,740 --> 00:15:49,659
I'll cut you some slack!

300
00:15:49,720 --> 00:15:50,659
Don't run if you've got the guts!

301
00:15:50,960 --> 00:15:51,320
I'm telling you!

302
00:15:51,320 --> 00:15:52,419
You won't quit until I beat you, huh?

303
00:15:58,039 --> 00:15:59,059
Let's get to the hospital, quick.

304
00:16:07,019 --> 00:16:07,879
Does it hurt?

305
00:16:09,460 --> 00:16:10,299
Not at all.

306
00:16:10,620 --> 00:16:11,679
It's nothing.

307
00:16:11,879 --> 00:16:13,700
Any later and it would've healed already.

308
00:16:17,360 --> 00:16:18,659
You think you're justified for fighting?

309
00:16:20,360 --> 00:16:21,879
W-Well, what else could I do?

310
00:16:22,179 --> 00:16:22,919
In that situation,

311
00:16:23,120 --> 00:16:24,259
I had no choice.

312
00:16:25,179 --> 00:16:27,639
Wasn't I just protecting your friend...

313
00:16:27,740 --> 00:16:29,159
...what's-his-name, Menglong?

314
00:16:31,659 --> 00:16:34,539
You did do the right thing this time.

315
00:16:35,440 --> 00:16:36,139
But let me tell you,

316
00:16:36,139 --> 00:16:37,059
don't let it happen again!

317
00:16:39,039 --> 00:16:40,659
Next time you fight like this

318
00:16:41,580 --> 00:16:42,440
and get hurt,

319
00:16:42,759 --> 00:16:43,779
nobody's gonna look after you.

320
00:16:44,039 --> 00:16:45,879
Nobody will bandage you up, I'm telling you.

321
00:16:50,440 --> 00:16:51,759
Such a huge gash.

322
00:16:54,059 --> 00:16:55,039
Family of Feng Menglong?

323
00:16:55,899 --> 00:16:56,759
His injuries are pretty bad.

324
00:16:56,820 --> 00:16:57,620
How did this happen?

325
00:16:58,799 --> 00:17:00,220
It's nothing, he just tripped and fell.

326
00:17:00,519 --> 00:17:00,960
Tripped and fell?

327
00:17:00,960 --> 00:17:01,860
Come on, trip like that and show me.

328
00:17:02,419 --> 00:17:03,340
Can't even tell a convincing lie.

329
00:17:03,919 --> 00:17:05,240
Go get him admitted right away.

330
00:17:05,380 --> 00:17:06,319
He needs to stay a few days for observation.

331
00:17:06,960 --> 00:17:07,380
Okay.

332
00:17:07,400 --> 00:17:07,880
Go on, hurry.

333
00:17:08,019 --> 00:17:08,779
I'm on it.

334
00:17:10,579 --> 00:17:11,039
Um...

335
00:17:11,980 --> 00:17:14,220
What... What did you just say?

336
00:17:14,519 --> 00:17:15,119
About...

337
00:17:15,839 --> 00:17:16,599
in the future...

338
00:17:17,500 --> 00:17:18,779
who'd bandage me up?

339
00:17:21,339 --> 00:17:22,059
Whoever wants to.

340
00:17:22,200 --> 00:17:22,900
I don't know.

341
00:17:26,200 --> 00:17:26,740
Disgusting.

342
00:17:31,359 --> 00:17:32,240
They said it's here.

343
00:17:34,720 --> 00:17:35,720
Menglong is in Ward Three.

344
00:17:36,480 --> 00:17:37,319
Wait, Daguang?

345
00:17:37,940 --> 00:17:38,480
Zhuzi!

346
00:17:38,680 --> 00:17:39,519
What are you guys doing...

347
00:17:39,579 --> 00:17:40,660
Hey, let's catch up later!

348
00:17:43,940 --> 00:17:45,799
Looks like they know your friend.

349
00:17:47,099 --> 00:17:48,460
What do they do?

350
00:17:49,339 --> 00:17:50,839
Th-They're my friends.

351
00:18:07,099 --> 00:18:08,539
I know everything that happened.

352
00:18:10,559 --> 00:18:11,099
Zhuzi,

353
00:18:11,779 --> 00:18:12,779
you're the one who brought him in.

354
00:18:14,819 --> 00:18:15,259
The two of us...

355
00:18:16,000 --> 00:18:16,940
You know each other?

356
00:18:21,759 --> 00:18:22,380
Feng Menglong...

357
00:18:24,059 --> 00:18:24,660
He's my own brother.
